  "strategy": "Clavile\u00f1o, First of the Blessed turns an attacking Vampire into a Demon each combat, and when that creature dies its controller draws a card and makes a 4/3 flying Vampire Demon, so the deck attacks with Vampires and is glad to lose them. Viscera Seer, Village Rites, Indulgent Aristocrat and Bloodline Necromancer turn bodies into value, while Blood Artist, Cruel Celebrant, Falkenrath Noble, Butcher of Malakir and Elenda, the Dusk Rose punish every death. Exquisite Blood, Sanctum Seeker, Elenda's Hierophant and Patron of the Vein turn the drain into a lifegain engine, Order of Sacred Dusk, Legion Lieutenant and Kindred Boon keep the tribe on the board, and Austere Command, Damn, Olivia's Wrath and Swords to Plowshares clear the way before Vona, Butcher of Magan and Glass-Cast Heart close the game.",
  "archetype": "aristocrats",
  "ratings": {
    "speed": 3,
    "complexity": 3,
    "interaction": 3,
    "resilience": 3,
    "pilot": 3
  },
  "signature": [
    {
      "card_id": "clavileno_first_of_the_blessed",
      "why": "Each attack makes a Vampire a Demon that leaves a card and a 4/3 flier behind when it dies."
    },
    {
      "card_id": "blood_artist",
      "why": "Every creature that dies drains a player for one."
    },
    {
      "card_id": "exquisite_blood",
      "why": "Every point an opponent loses comes back to you as life."
    },
    {
      "card_id": "timothar_baron_of_bats",
      "why": "A dead Vampire becomes a Bat that brings it back when it connects."
    }
  ],
